</small> <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions\" title=\"Champion of Champions\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_2\" title=\"Champion of Champions 2\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_3\" title=\"Champion of Champions 3\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_4\" title=\"Champion of Champions 4\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_5\" title=\"Champion of Champions 5\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\"><small>New Year Treat:</small> <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_1\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_2\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_3\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_4\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_5\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_6\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">6</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_7\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">An imbalance in the poppability.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oatmeal_and_death.\" title=\"Oatmeal and death.\">Oatmeal and death.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_end_of_the_franchise.\" title=\"The end of the franchise.\">The end of the franchise.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_customised_inhaler.\" title=\"The customised inhaler.\">The customised inhaler.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Croissants_is_croissants.\" title=\"Croissants is croissants.\">Croissants is croissants.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_chair_in_a_sweet.\" title=\"A chair in a sweet.\">A chair in a sweet.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.\" title=\"The integrity of the product.\">The integrity of the product.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.\" title=\"A couple of Ethels.\">A couple of Ethels.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nothing_matters.\" title=\"Nothing matters.\">Nothing matters.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caring_Uncle_Minpict.\" title=\"Caring Uncle Minpict.\">Caring Uncle Minpict.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">An imbalance in the poppability.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/04/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability..png/revision/latest?cb=20210924173502\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"An imbalance in the poppability.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/04/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210924173502\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/04/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210924173502 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/04/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability..png/revision/latest?cb=20210924173502 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"An imbalance in the poppability.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"An_imbalance_in_the_poppability..png\" data-image-name=\"An imbalance in the poppability..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\">Morgana Robinson</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Jamali.\" title=\"Activate Jamali.\">Activate Jamali.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oatmeal_and_death.\" title=\"Oatmeal and death.\">Oatmeal and death.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>An imbalance in the poppability.</b></i> was the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">Series 12</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 23 September 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\">Morgana Robinson</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"An imbalance in the poppability\" was what <a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\">Guz Khan</a> blamed for his inability to <a href=\"/wiki/Pop_the_balloon\" title=\"Pop the balloon\">Pop the balloon</a>. The title card shows paint on a paintbrush, referencing <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_the_most_flattering_picture_of_the_Taskmaster_in_action\" title=\"Paint the most flattering picture of the Taskmaster in action\">Paint the most flattering picture of the Taskmaster in action</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En ubalance i knaldbarheden', which translates as 'An imbalance in the poppability'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Poksahtavuuden epätasapaino', which translates as 'An imbalance in the poppability'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Saxen och poppsnöret', which translates as 'The scissors and the pop-string'. The 'pop-string' here is a reference to the string which had to be cut to drop the portcullis on the balloon, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Pop_the_balloon\" title=\"Pop the balloon\">Pop the balloon</a> task. The word 'popsnöre' is usually used to refer to young pop musicians or pop music fans, though.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En sprettende ubalanse', which translates as 'A bouncing imbalance'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alan Davies</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Desiree Burch</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Guz Khan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Morgana Robinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_that,_if_you_put_it_in_a_bag_and_sit_on_it,_it_would_feel_the_nicest\" title=\"The thing that, if you put it in a bag and sit on it, it would feel the nicest\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing that if you put it in a bag and sat on it, it would feel the nicest.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_Alex_with_a_ball\" title=\"Strike Alex with a ball\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Strike Alex with a ball. Alex may not run, hide or leave the Taskmaster grounds. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus</b> for calling Alex a \"little fucker\"</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Paint_the_most_flattering_picture_of_the_Taskmaster_in_action\" title=\"Paint the most flattering picture of the Taskmaster in action\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Paint the most flattering picture of the Taskmaster in action on the canvas in the lab. The canvas will either be six inches or six feet above you. You must lie flat on your back on the creeper at all times. You must tell Alex if you want the canvas to be six inches or six feet above you within the next ten seconds.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pop_the_balloon\" title=\"Pop the balloon\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Pop the balloon. You must stay behind the rope at all times. You must not move the rope. You may buy the tools you need with time. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_a_pose_to_represent_your_cool_hobby,_fun_animal,_and_your_famous_person\" title=\"Strike a pose to represent your cool hobby, fun animal, and your famous person\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Write down a cool hobby, a fun animal and a famous person.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> Strike a pose to represent first, your cool hobby, then your fun animal, then your famous person. You must hold your pose until the end of the round. The Taskmaster will attempt to guess what each pose represents. You may not make a noise or movement when posed.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>17</b>\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>When first aired, the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Taskmaster Bleeped (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGFza21hc3Rlcl9CbGVlcGVkP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">bleeped</span> version was accidently broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a>, rather than the regular version.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> It was confirmed that this was a mistake, and the regular version would return the next week.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/imbalance-poppability\"><i>An imbalance in the poppability.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70913-001\"><i>An imbalance in the poppability.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability.?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=